1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

2
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Let's go!

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
This world is colorful and bright

4
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Truth and lies confuse our eyes

5
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Look carefully with your heart

6
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
The truth is just a thought away

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Hey you, good or bad, true or false

8
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,000
You can't escape this trial of the heart

9
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Take all your courage with you

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,000
Maybe you can save this world

11
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:21,560
Enraged Lord Eye merges with Phoenix Chicken

12
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,719
Becomes a giant monster

13
00:01:23,719 --> 00:01:27,000
Launches a devastating attack on Locky and the others

14
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:31,659
Can they defeat this crazed behemoth?

15
00:01:35,620 --> 00:01:37,219
Grand Finale

16
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:03,079
I finally got to save you once, too

17
00:02:04,859 --> 00:02:06,759
I won't fail to repay your kindness

18
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:20,259
Is this... what feelings are?

19
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,259
Big Ugly Bird

20
00:03:14,259 --> 00:03:16,719
You think just 'cause you're big, you can bully people

21
00:03:16,719 --> 00:03:18,280
I'll show you what I've got!

22
00:03:36,759 --> 00:03:43,359
Here I come!

23
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:20,939
After all that fighting, I forgot...

24
00:04:20,939 --> 00:04:22,319
His weakness is that gem!

25
00:04:22,319 --> 00:04:23,520
The gem!

26
00:04:23,520 --> 00:04:25,360
Hurry up!

27
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:45,879
Big stinky bird

28
00:05:05,899 --> 00:05:06,399
Damn it!

29
00:05:06,399 --> 00:05:07,659
Still no way?

30
00:05:07,659 --> 00:05:10,079
I have an idea.

31
00:05:10,079 --> 00:05:16,740
For Love and Ideals? Give me a break!

32
00:05:16,740 --> 00:05:21,759
You actually smashed my most treasured magnifying glass!

33
00:05:21,759 --> 00:05:25,379
So I'm going to help you!

34
00:05:25,379 --> 00:05:29,060
You know, The Illumin-Eye summoned by the flames at the corporation

35
00:05:29,060 --> 00:05:30,519
Once it's fully opened,

36
00:05:30,519 --> 00:05:33,839
the entire world will be flooded by Storm and seawater.

37
00:05:33,839 --> 00:05:37,139
The only way to stop The Illumin-Eye from opening is

38
00:05:37,139 --> 00:05:39,379
to put out these eight flames!

39
00:05:39,379 --> 00:05:54,000
Now's the time!

40
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,319
Come on!

41
00:06:07,839 --> 00:06:08,360
Okay!

42
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:10,360
Let's join forces and take him down.

43
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:18,360
Are you ready?

44
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:20,360
Ready!

45
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:22,360
Let's show him what we've got!

46
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:10,360
I'm ashamed I couldn't help when it mattered most.

47
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,360
Detective Chen

48
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,360
Don't say that.

49
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:15,360
Everyone here is a hero.

50
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:17,360
Nobody was afraid to make sacrifices.

51
00:07:17,360 --> 00:07:19,360
Is he

52
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:21,360
sacrificing himself?

53
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:30,360
Take that!!

54
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:50,680
Locky!

55
00:07:50,680 --> 00:08:04,520
Yeah.

56
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:07,040
It's all over.

57
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,340
What a pity.

58
00:08:08,340 --> 00:08:11,340
The Illumin-Eye escaped.

59
00:08:14,340 --> 00:08:17,340
The Illumin-Eye will definitely make a comeback!

60
00:08:21,340 --> 00:08:23,340
But little Locky, he—

61
00:08:28,340 --> 00:08:31,340
Uncle, we all came to see you.

62
00:08:33,340 --> 00:08:35,340
Uncle, you're so useless.

63
00:08:35,340 --> 00:08:36,519
You actually got hurt this badly.

64
00:08:36,519 --> 00:08:38,519
Oh right, today I have my favorite math class.

65
00:08:38,519 --> 00:08:40,100
I'll come see you again after school.

66
00:08:40,100 --> 00:08:40,519
Bye-bye.

67
00:08:40,519 --> 00:08:44,120
Who'd have thought

68
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:47,740
Ever since Locky defeated The Illumin-Eye with math problems,

69
00:08:47,740 --> 00:08:50,600
he'd actually be so into school.

70
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:54,320
Locky's finally willing to go to school.

71
00:09:01,980 --> 00:09:03,940
Hurry, Jingjing, we're going to be late.

72
00:09:13,940 --> 00:09:14,940
Locky!

73
00:09:14,940 --> 00:09:15,940
Wait for me!

74
00:09:58,899 --> 00:10:03,920
I really don't want to be alone and lonely.

75
00:10:03,940 --> 00:10:11,300
But life is bound to have some unhappiness.

76
00:10:11,300 --> 00:10:18,840
Saying goodbye to today always leaves you feeling a little lost

77
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:26,780
Looking to tomorrow, waving at me from the horizon

78
00:10:26,780 --> 00:10:30,720
Bright eyes are sparkling

79
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:34,120
A smile that faces the sunlight

80
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:41,740
Bravely speak out that tiny feeling treasured deep in your heart

81
00:10:41,740 --> 00:10:46,160
The morning breeze blows softly across my face

82
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:49,480
Taking childhood wishes away

83
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:54,899
It will quietly plant them at the crossroads of growing up